# Keep the backend build context small and never bake secrets, user data, or
# large model weights into the image (HARDENING_PLAN.md findings C3, H7).

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/.venv/
**/*.egg-info/

# Secrets — never baked into the image; docker-compose.yml injects these at
# container-start time via `env_file`, not build time.
**/.env

# User data and model weights — provisioned separately (README.md "Model
# Weights") and mounted as volumes, never shipped in the image.
backend/uploads/
backend/outputs/
backend/weights/
uploads/
outputs/
test_output.wav

# Database files
*.db
clonevoice_test.db

# OS / editor / VCS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.git/
.gitignore

# Top-level project docs not needed inside the image. Deliberately listed by
# exact name rather than a `*.md` wildcard, so this can't accidentally also
# match (and drop) backend/services/sv2tts/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICE.md, which the
# vendored SV2TTS code's MIT license requires shipping alongside it.
README.md
CLAUDE.md
HARDENING_PLAN.md
DATABASE_DESIGN.md
PHASE_1_BACKEND_PLAN.md
PHASE_2_BACKEND_HARDENING_PLAN.md
project_description.md
backend-review.md
